# Git workflow

Edmund is the sole contributor. Every hop is a PR: `feat/*` | `fix/*` | `chore/*` → `dev` → `main`. Merging `dev` into `main` is the release (macOS DMG + TestFlight). See AGENTS.md and docs/releasing.md.

- This directory stays on `dev`. For real work, `./scripts/worktree add <slug>` and edit in `../stage-wand-trees/…`. Never `git switch` this folder off `dev`.
- Never commit or push directly to `main` or `dev`; both are protected. Open a PR into `dev`; promote `dev` → `main` by PR only when asked to ship.
- Bump the version with `scripts/version.sh set X.Y.Z`; `VERSION` is the single source of truth.
- One branch per worktree, one PR per thread. No force-push of `main` or `dev`.
